\par }{\insrsid15795173 
\par }{\insrsid3486260 Basic span/ effective depth (d) <26*1=26    Modification factor =1
\par d>span /26
\par Minimum effective depth = 3800/26 =146.15mm
\par Assuming R12 bars D = d + concrete cover+ (bar diameter/2)
\par                                 D = 146.15 + 25 + 6 =177.15mm
\par }{\insrsid13529519 Choose  D = 15}{\insrsid3486260 0mm
\par Therefore, d}{\sub\insrsid3486260\charrsid14042993 1}{\insrsid13529519  = 150-25-6 =11}{\insrsid3486260 9mm
